OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after boy, 11,
OL,4,Ainjured in 'dog attack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after an
OL,7,F11-year-old boy was injured in an
OL,8,Falleged dog attack.
OL,10,FThree dogs were reported to be "out of
OL,11,Fcontrol" in the Scotland Hall Road area
OL,12,Fof Newton Heath in north Manchester at
OL,13,Fabout 16:00 BST on Thursday, Greater
OL,14,FManchester Police said.
OL,16,FThe force said one dog was seized and
OL,17,Fthe other two were placed in kennels.
OL,18,FThe boy suffered minor injuries.
OL,20,FA 31-year-old man has been held on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of possessing an aggressive
OL,22,Fanimal.
